  "$comment": "The governed registry. It governs Core; it is not Core. Core defines the grammar of authority and never owns the product-specific authorities themselves. Changing this file is an owner decision, not a build step: CODEOWNERS covers it, and the architectural gates read it rather than deciding for themselves.",
